          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "The Rust Standard Library is the foundation of portable Rust software, a",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "set of minimal and battle-tested shared abstractions for the ",
