            },
            {
              "text": "its documentation!",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Once you are familiar with the contents of the standard library you may",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "begin to find the verbosity of the prose distracting. At this stage in your",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
