              "style": "Plain",
              "url": "../book/ch15-02-deref.html#implicit-deref-coercions-with-functions-and-methods"
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Third, the standard library defines ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "The Rust Prelude",
              "style": "Plain",
              "path": "std::prelude"
            },
            {
              "text": ", a small collection",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "of items - mostly traits - that are imported into every module of every",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "crate. The traits in the prelude are pervasive, making the prelude",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "documentation a good entry point to learning about the library.",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "And finally, the standard library exports a number of standard macros, and",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "lists them on this page",
              "style": "Plain",
              "url": "#macros"
            },
            {
              "text": " (technically, not all of the standard",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
