            },
            {
              "text": "compiler - but they are documented here the same). Like the prelude, the",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "standard macros are imported by default into all crates.",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
